      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The historic “Welcome to Clintonville” signs greet drivers at the main entryways, a tradition highlighted in the neighborhood’s landmarks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
