        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clintonville_(Columbus%2C_Ohio)",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Clintonville’s Old Beechwold neighborhood is the only one listed on the city, state, and National Historic Registry.",
